## Why the split

The repository is two different kinds of thing and one licence fits neither well.
Software licences are written about source code, object code, derivative works and
patents, and none of those concepts land cleanly on a file of 200 sentences a person
labelled by hand. CC BY is written for exactly that, and it keeps attribution attached
to the part of this project that cost human hours rather than compute.

